{
  "id": "1SA.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samwil 17",
  "verseCount": 58,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie Jufilisti gicoko njuru asikari migi karacelo ba lwiny; man gicokri karacelo i Soko, ma en e piny pa Yuda, man gigonjo kind Soko kud Azeka, i Efes-damim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Saul ku dhanu mir Israel gicokri karacelo, man gigonjo i poga mir Ela, man githero lwiny kum Jufilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Jufilisti gicungo wi got yo kurucel, man Israel ucungo wi got yo kurucel: man poga ni i kindgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jarukara acel uai kud i ka ma Jufilisti gonjo i ie, ma nyinge Goliath, ma Gath, ma kadongone bot abusiel ku katumbla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebedo ku kujanjra mi mola i wie, man eronyo kendi mir ali; man pek mi kendine en e cekel mi mola rubanga abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebedo kud ungoli mi mola kor tiende, man asi mi mola i kind goke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ruvangu pare en e calu yen pa jacwibongu; man lak tong’ pare pekne en e cekel mi nyunyu dak abusiel: man jayeiban pare cidho i wang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ecungo elwong’o ba njuru asikari mir Israel, man ewacu igi kumae, Wuloro piny nithero lwiny mu nedi? an a Jafilisti ngo, man wun wu jutic pa Saul ungo? wugoi wi ng’atu acel iwu, man wuwek elor piny i bang’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek ecopo kiedo kuda, manenega, wabidong’ bedo jutic mu; ento tek avoye, man anege, e wubidong’ bedo jutic mwa, man wubitimo iwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Jafilisti wacu kumae, Ahero njuru asikari mir Israel i ceng’ maeni; wuwodh ng’atu acel, kara wakied wakude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma Saul kud Israel ceke giwinjo lembe maeno pa Jafilisti, ewinygi ng’abre, man lworo negogi dit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u Daudi en c wod Jaefrathi maeno ma Beth-lehem-yuda, ma nyinge Yese; man wote abora: man ng’atuno ti i nindo pa Saul, ma rundi pare doko dupa i kind dhanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wot Yese adek ma dongo gicidho tok Saul i lwiny: man nying’ wote adek ma gicidho i lwiny ma kayu Eliab, m’ulubo ng’eye ke Abinadab, man mir adege ke Cama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi en e cogo; man gin adek ma dongo gilubo tok Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u Daudine ebedeai ku ba Saul kara ecidh ekwai rombe pa won i Beth-lehem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Jafilistine ebedecoro ceng’ni kugweno man uthieno, man ewodhre ceng’ pier ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yese wacu ni Daudi ma wode kumae, Gam cam katoko acel maeni, m’acela, ku lungu kwen maeni apar ni utumeru, man itergi pio ba utumerugi i kagonjo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man iter jamcak apar maeni ba jego mi rubanga migi, man inen maram utumeru bedo ko, man igam lembe m’i bang’gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u Saul, ku gin, ku dhanu mir Israel ceke gini i poga mi Ela, gibekiedo ku Jufilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi ai pir kugweno, man eweko rombe dong’ ku jakwac, man eting’o, ecidho de, calu Yese ng’olo ire; man etundo i ka ma magali ni ie, kinde ma udul asikari m’ubecidho nikiedo uwoi mir ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Israel ku Jufilisti githero lwiny, njuru asikari dhu njuru asikari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi weko jamni pare i cing’ jagwok jamni, man eringo ba njuru asikarine, e ebino emotho utumin mire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma gibeweco gikugi, nen, jarukara wodhre, ku kind udul Jufilisti, en e Jafilisti ma Gath, ma nyinge Goliath, man eyero calu ebedeyero: e Daudi winjogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dhanu mir Israel ceke, ka gineno ng’atuno, giringe, man lworo negogi dit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dhanu mir Israel giwacu kumae, Wuneno ng’atu maeni m’uwodhre? ewodhre kara ecai Israel andha: man ebibedo, nia ng’atu m’unege, ubimo bilonye ku lonyo ma dit, man ebimio ire nyare, man ebiketho ot pa won ubed agonya i kind Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi yero ni dhanu m’ucungo i vute, ewacu kumae, Jubitimo ang’o ni ng’atu m’unego Jafilisti maeni, man ekabu cac woko ku wi Israeli? kum Jafilisti maeni ma jutimo yaa ngo i kume en e ng’a, ma nia ecayu njuru asikari pa Mungu ma kwo e? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dhanu giloko lembe ire calu maeni, giwacu kumae, Jubitimo kumeni ni ng’atu m’unege.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Eliab m’umin ma kayu winjo kinde m’eyero ni dhanune; man ng’ecwiny pa Eliab uopo kum Daudi, ewacu de kumae, Nedi iloro pinyi? man iweko rombe maeca ma nok i langa ku ng’a? Ang’eyo kuhaya peri, ku ndre mir adundeni; kum iloro piny kara inen lwiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu kumae, Atimo ang’o kawono? There mbe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eai woko kud i bang’e man elokre yo ba ng’atu mange, man eweco ceke acel: man dhanu giloko ire lembe kendo calu ma kwong’a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka juwinjo lembe maeni ma Daudi yero, juyerogi i wang’ Saul; man eoro julwong’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ni Saul kumae, Kud iyi adunde ng’atu moko miel kum ng’atuno; jatic peri bicidho bikiedo ku Jafilisti maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Saul uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Icopo cidho ba Jafilisti maeni ngo ma nia wukied kude; kum fodi in aradu, man en e dhanu mir ali ugambre i aradu pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi wacu ni Saul kumae, Jatic peri bekwayu rombe pa won; man kan umvor, kadi undiek ubino, man emaku nyathi rombo ku kind udul rombe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alubo toke, e agoye, man abodhe kud i dhoge; e kan ejai ira, amake ku tike, man agoye, anege de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jatic peri goyo umvor kud undiek de: man Jafilisti maeni ma jutimo yaa ngo i kume ebibedo calu kindgi acel, kum ecayu njuru asikari pa Mungu ma kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu kumae, Yehova m’ubodha kud i cing umvor, man kud i cing undiek, ebibodha kud i cing’ Jafilisti maeni. E Saul uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Cidhi, man Yehova bibedo kudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Saul uronyo Daudi ku kendi pare, man elutho kujanjra mi mola i wie, eronye de kud asi mir umbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi twio palamularu pare wi kendi pare, man eponjo cidho; kum fodi eponje ngo. Daudi wacu ni Saul kumae, Acopo cidho ku maeni ngo; kum fodi aponjogi ngo. Man Daudi wodhogi woko kud i kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eting’o musongolo pare i cinge, man ekwanyu kidi ma kume pele pele abic ire kud i kulo, man ekethogi i usau mi kwac ma ni i bang’e, en e upiru pare; man jungbe pare ni i cinge: e ecoro ceng’ni kum Jafilisti nino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Jafilistine bino man ecoro ceng’ni Daudi; e ng’atu m’uyeyo ban utelo yo i wang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ka Jafilisti neno kun ku kun, man eneno Daudi, ecaye; kum fodi en e aradu, man e landu, en e ng’atu ma wang’e ber de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Jafilisti wacu ni Daudi kumae, An a gwoki, ma nia ibino i bang’a ku yen e? E Jafilistine lamu Daudi ku mungu pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Jafilisti wacu ni Daudi kumae, Bin i bang’a, man abimio ring’kumi ni winyo ma kor polo, man ni yedi m’i thim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi lund uwacu ni Jafilisti kumae, Ibino i bang’a ku palamularu, man ku tong’, man ku pindo: ento abino i beng’i ku nying’ Yehova mir udul, en e Mungu mi njuru asikari mir Israel, m’icayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova bimii i cinga tin; man abigoyi, man abithumo wii kud i kumi; man abimio avuj udul mi Jufilisti ni winyo ma kor polo tin, man ni yedi m’i thim m’i ng’om; kara ng’om ceke ging’ei nia Mungu nuti i kind Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man kara cokri maeni ceke ging’ei nia Yehova bodho ku palamularu man ku tong’ ungo: kum lwiny en e pa Yehova, man ebimiowu i cingwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde ma Jafilistine ai malu, man ebino ecoro ceng’ni kara eromb ku Daudi, nia Daudi timo pio, man eringo yo ba njuru asikari kara eromb ku Jafilistine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi royo cinge i usau pare, man ewodho kidi kud i ie, e ecanye, man ecanyu Jafilisti i ternyime; e kidi mwony i ternyime, man epodho arieba wang’e i ng’om.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
